"Set the possibility of returning home without the extraction point.\n"
"With this option, you will receive a spell that will return you home at any time by paying 1 warp shard.  It takes one minute to cast.  You may not be near any enemies when the spell is successfully cast or it will have no effect."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck_3"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"Set the possibility of returning home without the extraction point.\n"
"With this option, you will receive a recipe to craft a Warped Skyward Beacon.  This costs 5 warp shards and when used, casts the Warped Return spell."
msgstr ""

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck_3"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
